00:30:05.408 --> 00:30:06.603
Proposed design.

494
00:30:06.883 --> 00:30:12.131
A client library (in the service template) wraps RestClient or gRPC stubs.

495
00:30:12.411 --> 00:30:25.125
It reads the incoming deadline, computes the remaining budget, applies per-dependency timeouts (config), attaches deadline headers, enforces a per-dependency concurrency limit, and exposes metrics.

496
00:30:25.405 --> 00:30:35.667
Direct use of raw clients fails a lint rule. gRPC for internal synchronous calls with more than 100 req per second (pricing, inventory, cart).

497
00:30:35.947 --> 00:30:38.059
REST for everything else and at the edge.

498
00:30:38.339 --> 00:30:42.840
The.proto files live in a shared schema repo with buf breaking in CI.

499
00:30:44.190 --> 00:30:53.193
Retries: the gateway retries idempotent GETs once on another instance, and the mesh does not retry (it's disabled, to avoid double retries).

500
00:30:53.473 --> 00:30:59.105
Payment calls use idempotency keys and are retried only by the saga (Ch 13).

501
00:30:59.385 --> 00:31:05.081
Fallbacks are declared per call: required (fail fast) or optional (default value + flag).

502
00:31:05.361 --> 00:31:06.534
